DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260808T180000
SUMMARY:Mosaics Beginning Korean on Zoom
DESCRIPTION:Intercultural Mosaics\n**Discover Intercultural Mosaics Hub 
 – Summer 2026!**\nJoin us for a vibrant and uplifting season of virtual 
 learning and community from **June 20 to August 29\, 2026**—all from the
  comfort of your home on Zoom!\n\n**Bi-Weekly Friday Zoom Sessions** *(Eve
 ry 2nd and 4th Friday)*\n• **4:00 PM** – Advanced Korean with Stephen\
 n• **5:00 PM** – Intermediate Conversational Chinese with Sam\n• **6
 :00 PM** – Bible Study & Meditation Group with Stephen\n• **7:00 PM** 
 – Beginning Chinese with Jane\n\n**Weekly Saturday Zoom Sessions** (tota
 l of 10 sessions)\n• **4:00 PM** – Beginning Spanish with Viviana\n•
  **5:00 PM** – Beginning to Intermediate Korean with Stephen\n• **6:00
  PM** – Beginning to Intermediate Japanese with Norio\n• **7:00 PM** 
 – English Learners Group with Linda & Chad\n\n***\n\n**Important Notes:*
 *\n\n1. **No Zoom sessions** on **July 3–4\, 2026** (Independence Day) a
 nd **September 4–5\, 2026** (Labor Day).\n2. All classes will be conduct
 ed **exclusively via Zoom** during the summer session.\n3. **Return to In-
 Person Meetings:**\nWe will resume our **regular in-person gatherings on S
 eptember 12\, 2026** at the **2nd floor rooms of Phoenix Hall\, Davis Comm
 unity Church**.\n\nFor more information about Intercultural Mosaics classe
 s and activities\, visit [www.nextg.org](http://www.nextg.org/) or contact
  Dr. Stephen Moon at 916-217-5470\nor email to: [catalyst@nextg.org](mailt
 o:catalyst@nextg.org). Thank you!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/mosaics/events/315754611/
